kaos-droidian-integration (0.0.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial Kaos Droidian integration package.
  * Port runtime patches from SetupManager.java to build-time files:
    phosh/hwcomposer BindsTo= overrides, debug logging drop-ins,
    patched phosh-session wrapper, halium-lxc-exec path override,
    and hwcomposer-null RC for LXC bind-mount.

